[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.420",
    "end": "00:00:03.240",
    "start_seconds": 0.42,
    "end_seconds": 3.24,
    "text": "- You're going to learn all about what executive presence is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.240",
    "end": "00:00:06.030",
    "start_seconds": 3.24,
    "end_seconds": 6.03,
    "text": "and how you can have more of it yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.030",
    "end": "00:00:08.760",
    "start_seconds": 6.03,
    "end_seconds": 8.76,
    "text": "And to do that, we are going to be talking with a good friend"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.760",
    "end": "00:00:10.290",
    "start_seconds": 8.76,
    "end_seconds": 10.29,
    "text": "of mine, Allen Weiner."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.290",
    "end": "00:00:13.290",
    "start_seconds": 10.29,
    "end_seconds": 13.29,
    "text": "He is the author of the new book called The Highflier"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.290",
    "end": "00:00:16.410",
    "start_seconds": 13.29,
    "end_seconds": 16.41,
    "text": "Handbook, that book's all about how you can be seen"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.410",
    "end": "00:00:18.120",
    "start_seconds": 16.41,
    "end_seconds": 18.12,
    "text": "as a leader at work, and then of course,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.120",
    "end": "00:00:20.040",
    "start_seconds": 18.12,
    "end_seconds": 20.04,
    "text": "how you can become one yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.040",
    "end": "00:00:22.530",
    "start_seconds": 20.04,
    "end_seconds": 22.53,
    "text": "This is part one in a three-part series with Alan"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.530",
    "end": "00:00:26.430",
    "start_seconds": 22.53,
    "end_seconds": 26.43,
    "text": "that we're doing, unpacking three pieces of his book."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.430",
    "end": "00:00:28.140",
    "start_seconds": 26.43,
    "end_seconds": 28.14,
    "text": "So, welcome, Allen. My first question"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:28.140",
    "end": "00:00:29.610",
    "start_seconds": 28.14,
    "end_seconds": 29.61,
    "text": "that I'm going to pitch right to you is,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.610",
    "end": "00:00:33.090",
    "start_seconds": 29.61,
    "end_seconds": 33.09,
    "text": "what's the most common question you get at your firm?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:34.200",
    "end": "00:00:35.430",
    "start_seconds": 34.2,
    "end_seconds": 35.43,
    "text": "- For sure."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.430",
    "end": "00:00:39.450",
    "start_seconds": 35.43,
    "end_seconds": 39.45,
    "text": "It's how could we develop more executive presence in all"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.450",
    "end": "00:00:40.830",
    "start_seconds": 39.45,
    "end_seconds": 40.83,
    "text": "of the people who work here?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.830",
    "end": "00:00:42.810",
    "start_seconds": 40.83,
    "end_seconds": 42.81,
    "text": "Certainly the senior executives,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.810",
    "end": "00:00:46.050",
    "start_seconds": 42.81,
    "end_seconds": 46.05,
    "text": "but they're all using the term executive presence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.050",
    "end": "00:00:48.630",
    "start_seconds": 46.05,
    "end_seconds": 48.63,
    "text": "- Right. And you've been working now doing, you're like one"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.630",
    "end": "00:00:51.090",
    "start_seconds": 48.63,
    "end_seconds": 51.09,
    "text": "of the original executive coaches"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.090",
    "end": "00:00:52.740",
    "start_seconds": 51.09,
    "end_seconds": 52.74,
    "text": "specializing in communication."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.740",
    "end": "00:00:54.660",
    "start_seconds": 52.74,
    "end_seconds": 54.66,
    "text": "There's a lot of 'em out there now,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.660",
    "end": "00:00:58.170",
    "start_seconds": 54.66,
    "end_seconds": 58.17,
    "text": "but as the young people say, you are one of the O.G,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.170",
    "end": "00:01:00.270",
    "start_seconds": 58.17,
    "end_seconds": 60.27,
    "text": "the \"original gangster\" executive coaches."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.270",
    "end": "00:01:03.120",
    "start_seconds": 60.27,
    "end_seconds": 63.12,
    "text": "That's right. So you've been, you've been observing Fortune"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.120",
    "end": "00:01:06.750",
    "start_seconds": 63.12,
    "end_seconds": 66.75,
    "text": "500 CEOs for decades, very C-suite executives."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.750",
    "end": "00:01:09.090",
    "start_seconds": 66.75,
    "end_seconds": 69.09,
    "text": "You've been around people with executive presence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.090",
    "end": "00:01:12.210",
    "start_seconds": 69.09,
    "end_seconds": 72.21000000000001,
    "text": "Some people call it pizazz, some people call it flare."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.210",
    "end": "00:01:14.100",
    "start_seconds": 72.21000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 74.1,
    "text": "Some people call charisma these days."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.100",
    "end": "00:01:15.990",
    "start_seconds": 74.1,
    "end_seconds": 75.99,
    "text": "That's a big word today, charisma."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.990",
    "end": "00:01:17.250",
    "start_seconds": 75.99,
    "end_seconds": 77.25,
    "text": "The through line,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.250",
    "end": "00:01:19.500",
    "start_seconds": 77.25,
    "end_seconds": 79.5,
    "text": "through all this is its executive presence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.500",
    "end": "00:01:22.440",
    "start_seconds": 79.5,
    "end_seconds": 82.44,
    "text": "So in terms of that phrase, executive presence, what does"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.440",
    "end": "00:01:24.720",
    "start_seconds": 82.44,
    "end_seconds": 84.72,
    "text": "that mean to you in everyday language?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.720",
    "end": "00:01:28.320",
    "start_seconds": 84.72,
    "end_seconds": 88.32,
    "text": "- Well, it actually started with a second to five qualities"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.320",
    "end": "00:01:29.400",
    "start_seconds": 88.32,
    "end_seconds": 89.4,
    "text": "of credibility"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.400",
    "end": "00:01:32.550",
    "start_seconds": 89.4,
    "end_seconds": 92.55,
    "text": "and leadership, which has always been called composure."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.550",
    "end": "00:01:35.610",
    "start_seconds": 92.55,
    "end_seconds": 95.61,
    "text": "So when I first started hearing the word executive presence,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:35.610",
    "end": "00:01:38.910",
    "start_seconds": 95.61,
    "end_seconds": 98.91,
    "text": "it just took me back to all of the early research on"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:38.910",
    "end": "00:01:41.070",
    "start_seconds": 98.91,
    "end_seconds": 101.07,
    "text": "what was called executive composure."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41.070",
    "end": "00:01:45.660",
    "start_seconds": 101.07,
    "end_seconds": 105.66,
    "text": "Composure. Like composed not all over the place,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.660",
    "end": "00:01:47.010",
    "start_seconds": 105.66,
    "end_seconds": 107.00999999999999,
    "text": "implies some kind"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.010",
    "end": "00:01:50.640",
    "start_seconds": 107.00999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 110.64,
    "text": "of control over the way people express themselves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.640",
    "end": "00:01:52.410",
    "start_seconds": 110.64,
    "end_seconds": 112.41,
    "text": "- And then that comes across in the book"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.410",
    "end": "00:01:53.910",
    "start_seconds": 112.41,
    "end_seconds": 113.91,
    "text": "as you described it, instead of thinking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.910",
    "end": "00:01:56.340",
    "start_seconds": 113.91,
    "end_seconds": 116.34,
    "text": "of executive presence, think of it as"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.340",
    "end": "00:01:58.650",
    "start_seconds": 116.34,
    "end_seconds": 118.65,
    "text": "that executive's presence in the room,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.650",
    "end": "00:02:01.320",
    "start_seconds": 118.65,
    "end_seconds": 121.32,
    "text": "how people feel their presence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.320",
    "end": "00:02:04.320",
    "start_seconds": 121.32,
    "end_seconds": 124.32,
    "text": "- Right. You know, one of my favorite stories is A CEO"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.320",
    "end": "00:02:07.020",
    "start_seconds": 124.32,
    "end_seconds": 127.02,
    "text": "who said to me, people come into the office,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.020",
    "end": "00:02:09.750",
    "start_seconds": 127.02,
    "end_seconds": 129.75,
    "text": "senior level people, and they talk to me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.750",
    "end": "00:02:13.230",
    "start_seconds": 129.75,
    "end_seconds": 133.23,
    "text": "and it sounds like a drum solo in a jazz club."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.230",
    "end": "00:02:14.280",
    "start_seconds": 133.23,
    "end_seconds": 134.28,
    "text": "It's all over the place."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.280",
    "end": "00:02:16.170",
    "start_seconds": 134.28,
    "end_seconds": 136.17000000000002,
    "text": "And sometimes they run up to the whiteboard"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.170",
    "end": "00:02:19.830",
    "start_seconds": 136.17000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 139.82999999999998,
    "text": "and just start drawing stuff while they're talking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19.830",
    "end": "00:02:21.630",
    "start_seconds": 139.82999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 141.63,
    "text": "Can you coach them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.630",
    "end": "00:02:25.950",
    "start_seconds": 141.63,
    "end_seconds": 145.95,
    "text": "to sound more like a composition like Mozart,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.950",
    "end": "00:02:28.470",
    "start_seconds": 145.95,
    "end_seconds": 148.47,
    "text": "where there's a beginning, middle, and an end?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.470",
    "end": "00:02:30.930",
    "start_seconds": 148.47,
    "end_seconds": 150.93,
    "text": "That is what most of people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:30.930",
    "end": "00:02:34.500",
    "start_seconds": 150.93,
    "end_seconds": 154.5,
    "text": "who are looking at this experience all over the place."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.500",
    "end": "00:02:37.440",
    "start_seconds": 154.5,
    "end_seconds": 157.44,
    "text": "- Right? So we see in a person who's all over the place,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.440",
    "end": "00:02:39.540",
    "start_seconds": 157.44,
    "end_seconds": 159.54,
    "text": "they're lacking that composure."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.540",
    "end": "00:02:42.480",
    "start_seconds": 159.54,
    "end_seconds": 162.48,
    "text": "And we do not see that as executive presence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.480",
    "end": "00:02:44.910",
    "start_seconds": 162.48,
    "end_seconds": 164.91,
    "text": "In contrast, you talk about control"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.910",
    "end": "00:02:48.960",
    "start_seconds": 164.91,
    "end_seconds": 168.96,
    "text": "and composure in terms of how they present themselves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.960",
    "end": "00:02:52.590",
    "start_seconds": 168.96,
    "end_seconds": 172.59,
    "text": "And you mentioned, for example, movies The Godfather."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.590",
    "end": "00:02:54.960",
    "start_seconds": 172.59,
    "end_seconds": 174.96,
    "text": "Can you talk about more what that self-control?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.960",
    "end": "00:02:56.880",
    "start_seconds": 174.96,
    "end_seconds": 176.88,
    "text": "Because when we say control, a lot of people think, oh,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.880",
    "end": "00:02:58.620",
    "start_seconds": 176.88,
    "end_seconds": 178.62,
    "text": "you mean control other people?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.620",
    "end": "00:02:59.920",
    "start_seconds": 178.62,
    "end_seconds": 179.92000000000002,
    "text": "But that's not what you're talking about."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.920",
    "end": "00:03:02.800",
    "start_seconds": 179.92000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 182.8,
    "text": "You're talking about their ability to stay in control"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.800",
    "end": "00:03:04.930",
    "start_seconds": 182.8,
    "end_seconds": 184.93,
    "text": "of themselves and to stay composed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.930",
    "end": "00:03:06.190",
    "start_seconds": 184.93,
    "end_seconds": 186.19,
    "text": "And you mentioned The Godfather,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.190",
    "end": "00:03:07.540",
    "start_seconds": 186.19,
    "end_seconds": 187.54,
    "text": "which I think is a great example."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.410",
    "end": "00:03:11.500",
    "start_seconds": 188.41,
    "end_seconds": 191.5,
    "text": "- Well, what happens there is a, there's a scene"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.500",
    "end": "00:03:14.080",
    "start_seconds": 191.5,
    "end_seconds": 194.08,
    "text": "and Marlon Brando, who plays the Godfather,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.080",
    "end": "00:03:18.940",
    "start_seconds": 194.08,
    "end_seconds": 198.94,
    "text": "does not move a muscle while another person coming to him"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.940",
    "end": "00:03:21.130",
    "start_seconds": 198.94,
    "end_seconds": 201.13,
    "text": "for a favor is asking for it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.130",
    "end": "00:03:23.830",
    "start_seconds": 201.13,
    "end_seconds": 203.82999999999998,
    "text": "So he sits generally like this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.700",
    "end": "00:03:29.290",
    "start_seconds": 207.7,
    "end_seconds": 209.29,
    "text": "doesn't even nod his head."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.290",
    "end": "00:03:33.370",
    "start_seconds": 209.29,
    "end_seconds": 213.37,
    "text": "And at the end of that scene, he puts a cat down"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.370",
    "end": "00:03:35.590",
    "start_seconds": 213.37,
    "end_seconds": 215.59,
    "text": "and then finally talks a little himself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.590",
    "end": "00:03:37.210",
    "start_seconds": 215.59,
    "end_seconds": 217.21,
    "text": "And when he does that,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.210",
    "end": "00:03:39.430",
    "start_seconds": 217.21,
    "end_seconds": 219.43,
    "text": "there's an amazing amount of control there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.430",
    "end": "00:03:42.400",
    "start_seconds": 219.43,
    "end_seconds": 222.4,
    "text": "He says something like, you come to me asking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.400",
    "end": "00:03:44.530",
    "start_seconds": 222.4,
    "end_seconds": 224.53,
    "text": "for justice pause."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:45.550",
    "end": "00:03:48.970",
    "start_seconds": 225.55,
    "end_seconds": 228.97,
    "text": "- Mm. - Yet you've never invited me to your home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.290",
    "end": "00:03:54.070",
    "start_seconds": 230.29,
    "end_seconds": 234.07,
    "text": "Pause. So that means someone exuding that same level"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.070",
    "end": "00:03:56.140",
    "start_seconds": 234.07,
    "end_seconds": 236.14,
    "text": "of control in a meeting."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.140",
    "end": "00:04:00.520",
    "start_seconds": 236.14,
    "end_seconds": 240.52,
    "text": "Mike say something like, that's what we're here for."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.520",
    "end": "00:04:05.520",
    "start_seconds": 240.52,
    "end_seconds": 245.52,
    "text": "I want to hear more about that. Why don't we get started?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.755",
    "end": "00:04:08.080",
    "start_seconds": 245.755,
    "end_seconds": 248.08,
    "text": "It, it has that kind of quality to it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.080",
    "end": "00:04:12.490",
    "start_seconds": 248.08,
    "end_seconds": 252.49,
    "text": "- Very crisp communication, very composed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.490",
    "end": "00:04:14.410",
    "start_seconds": 252.49,
    "end_seconds": 254.41,
    "text": "presentation of themselves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.410",
    "end": "00:04:17.590",
    "start_seconds": 254.41,
    "end_seconds": 257.59,
    "text": "They're not flailing around, they're not doing a drum solo."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.590",
    "end": "00:04:18.880",
    "start_seconds": 257.59,
    "end_seconds": 258.88,
    "text": "Interestingly, it's not a drum solo."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.880",
    "end": "00:04:21.610",
    "start_seconds": 258.88,
    "end_seconds": 261.61,
    "text": "It's composed just like a, you know, just"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.610",
    "end": "00:04:23.500",
    "start_seconds": 261.61,
    "end_seconds": 263.5,
    "text": "- Musical piece. Just like a composition piece. Right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.500",
    "end": "00:04:25.720",
    "start_seconds": 263.5,
    "end_seconds": 265.72,
    "text": "- You also talk about gravitas in the book"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:25.720",
    "end": "00:04:28.030",
    "start_seconds": 265.72,
    "end_seconds": 268.03,
    "text": "and how people often ask, Hey, we want to speak"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.030",
    "end": "00:04:29.650",
    "start_seconds": 268.03,
    "end_seconds": 269.65,
    "text": "with more gravitas."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.650",
    "end": "00:04:30.700",
    "start_seconds": 269.65,
    "end_seconds": 270.7,
    "text": "So what do they mean by that?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.700",
    "end": "00:04:32.920",
    "start_seconds": 270.7,
    "end_seconds": 272.92,
    "text": "And how would you coach people to have more gravitas?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.920",
    "end": "00:04:36.070",
    "start_seconds": 272.92,
    "end_seconds": 276.07,
    "text": "- Well, gravitas has become yet another word that's used"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.070",
    "end": "00:04:38.110",
    "start_seconds": 276.07,
    "end_seconds": 278.11,
    "text": "to describe executive composure."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.110",
    "end": "00:04:41.470",
    "start_seconds": 278.11,
    "end_seconds": 281.47,
    "text": "Sometimes the call is, can you help develop gravitas?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.470",
    "end": "00:04:44.920",
    "start_seconds": 281.47,
    "end_seconds": 284.92,
    "text": "Well, as the word implies, there's a certain gravity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.920",
    "end": "00:04:48.040",
    "start_seconds": 284.92,
    "end_seconds": 288.04,
    "text": "to the way people express themselves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.040",
    "end": "00:04:51.880",
    "start_seconds": 288.04,
    "end_seconds": 291.88,
    "text": "The simplest example of that is in speed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.880",
    "end": "00:04:55.900",
    "start_seconds": 291.88,
    "end_seconds": 295.9,
    "text": "There's an example in my first book where a president says,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.900",
    "end": "00:04:58.840",
    "start_seconds": 295.9,
    "end_seconds": 298.84000000000003,
    "text": "Americans have a right to safety in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.840",
    "end": "00:05:01.330",
    "start_seconds": 298.84000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 301.33,
    "text": "and around their homes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.230",
    "end": "00:05:07.230",
    "start_seconds": 302.23,
    "end_seconds": 307.23,
    "text": "That gravity of bringing the tone of voice down, a tone as"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.660",
    "end": "00:05:12.040",
    "start_seconds": 307.66,
    "end_seconds": 312.04,
    "text": "he gets to the end, that's what gravitas means."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.040",
    "end": "00:05:13.810",
    "start_seconds": 312.04,
    "end_seconds": 313.81,
    "text": "Weightiness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.810",
    "end": "00:05:18.010",
    "start_seconds": 313.81,
    "end_seconds": 318.01,
    "text": "Now, hopefully the content itself has weightiness,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.010",
    "end": "00:05:21.310",
    "start_seconds": 318.01,
    "end_seconds": 321.31,
    "text": "but as I always tell clients, we're a songwriting team."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.310",
    "end": "00:05:23.650",
    "start_seconds": 321.31,
    "end_seconds": 323.65,
    "text": "I don't write the lyrics to the songs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.650",
    "end": "00:05:28.210",
    "start_seconds": 323.65,
    "end_seconds": 328.21,
    "text": "So I hope that your content has gravity to it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.210",
    "end": "00:05:31.240",
    "start_seconds": 328.21,
    "end_seconds": 331.24,
    "text": "But as far as the description of it, how you say it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.240",
    "end": "00:05:33.460",
    "start_seconds": 331.24,
    "end_seconds": 333.46,
    "text": "it's going to be a little slower"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:33.460",
    "end": "00:05:35.530",
    "start_seconds": 333.46,
    "end_seconds": 335.53,
    "text": "and the tones will be a little deeper."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.530",
    "end": "00:05:38.650",
    "start_seconds": 335.53,
    "end_seconds": 338.65,
    "text": "- Yeah. And many times the clients we work with have a lot"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.650",
    "end": "00:05:40.240",
    "start_seconds": 338.65,
    "end_seconds": 340.24,
    "text": "to say they have substance,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.240",
    "end": "00:05:44.500",
    "start_seconds": 340.24,
    "end_seconds": 344.5,
    "text": "but their drum solo is getting in the way of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.500",
    "end": "00:05:47.290",
    "start_seconds": 344.5,
    "end_seconds": 347.29,
    "text": "that substance being heard in a really clear"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.290",
    "end": "00:05:48.820",
    "start_seconds": 347.29,
    "end_seconds": 348.82,
    "text": "and concise way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.820",
    "end": "00:05:50.410",
    "start_seconds": 348.82,
    "end_seconds": 350.40999999999997,
    "text": "So what's your advice about Q&A?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:50.410",
    "end": "00:05:54.340",
    "start_seconds": 350.40999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 354.34000000000003,
    "text": "I think at the end of the chapter about executive presence,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.340",
    "end": "00:05:56.770",
    "start_seconds": 354.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 356.77,
    "text": "there's a piece about how to handle q and a,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.770",
    "end": "00:05:59.360",
    "start_seconds": 356.77,
    "end_seconds": 359.36,
    "text": "because that's where a lot of this self-control"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.360",
    "end": "00:06:00.680",
    "start_seconds": 359.36,
    "end_seconds": 360.68,
    "text": "and composure comes together,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:00.680",
    "end": "00:06:03.740",
    "start_seconds": 360.68,
    "end_seconds": 363.74,
    "text": "because those are pressurized moments for some people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.740",
    "end": "00:06:06.110",
    "start_seconds": 363.74,
    "end_seconds": 366.11,
    "text": "So what's your advice about q and A?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.110",
    "end": "00:06:08.300",
    "start_seconds": 366.11,
    "end_seconds": 368.3,
    "text": "- This piece of advice about q"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.300",
    "end": "00:06:11.780",
    "start_seconds": 368.3,
    "end_seconds": 371.78,
    "text": "and a is one of the ones I am most happy about."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:11.780",
    "end": "00:06:15.470",
    "start_seconds": 371.78,
    "end_seconds": 375.47,
    "text": "This is something that I came onto at the very beginning"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:15.470",
    "end": "00:06:16.760",
    "start_seconds": 375.47,
    "end_seconds": 376.76,
    "text": "of my practice."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:16.760",
    "end": "00:06:18.740",
    "start_seconds": 376.76,
    "end_seconds": 378.74,
    "text": "All of the questions that all"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:18.740",
    "end": "00:06:23.060",
    "start_seconds": 378.74,
    "end_seconds": 383.06,
    "text": "of us get throughout our lives are very, very similar"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:23.060",
    "end": "00:06:26.210",
    "start_seconds": 383.06,
    "end_seconds": 386.21,
    "text": "to the questions we were asked on high school testing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.210",
    "end": "00:06:27.830",
    "start_seconds": 386.21,
    "end_seconds": 387.83,
    "text": "and college testing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:27.830",
    "end": "00:06:31.550",
    "start_seconds": 387.83,
    "end_seconds": 391.55,
    "text": "And they were called true, false, multiple choice,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:31.550",
    "end": "00:06:33.680",
    "start_seconds": 391.55,
    "end_seconds": 393.68,
    "text": "fill in the blank and essay."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:33.680",
    "end": "00:06:36.530",
    "start_seconds": 393.68,
    "end_seconds": 396.53,
    "text": "At least that's the way I experienced it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:36.530",
    "end": "00:06:38.060",
    "start_seconds": 396.53,
    "end_seconds": 398.06,
    "text": "So I tell my clients,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:38.060",
    "end": "00:06:41.060",
    "start_seconds": 398.06,
    "end_seconds": 401.06,
    "text": "if you are asked a question in a meeting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:41.060",
    "end": "00:06:42.710",
    "start_seconds": 401.06,
    "end_seconds": 402.71,
    "text": "that is seeking a yes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.710",
    "end": "00:06:47.120",
    "start_seconds": 402.71,
    "end_seconds": 407.12,
    "text": "or a no, no matter how complex the topic is,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:47.120",
    "end": "00:06:49.880",
    "start_seconds": 407.12,
    "end_seconds": 409.88,
    "text": "it's still a true false question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.880",
    "end": "00:06:53.510",
    "start_seconds": 409.88,
    "end_seconds": 413.51,
    "text": "So if, for instance, Alex, you asked me, do you think"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:53.510",
    "end": "00:06:56.450",
    "start_seconds": 413.51,
    "end_seconds": 416.45,
    "text": "that if we do it that way it's going to work"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.450",
    "end": "00:06:59.420",
    "start_seconds": 416.45,
    "end_seconds": 419.42,
    "text": "and I have all of these complex thoughts in my mind,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.420",
    "end": "00:07:02.810",
    "start_seconds": 419.42,
    "end_seconds": 422.81,
    "text": "I still have to say to myself, it's a true, false"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.810",
    "end": "00:07:04.670",
    "start_seconds": 422.81,
    "end_seconds": 424.67,
    "text": "or yes no question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.670",
    "end": "00:07:07.520",
    "start_seconds": 424.67,
    "end_seconds": 427.52,
    "text": "In other words, you could have sent me an email that said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.520",
    "end": "00:07:11.690",
    "start_seconds": 427.52,
    "end_seconds": 431.69,
    "text": "Alan, you think this is going to work true or false?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.690",
    "end": "00:07:13.850",
    "start_seconds": 431.69,
    "end_seconds": 433.85,
    "text": "Circle T or F, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:13.850",
    "end": "00:07:16.400",
    "start_seconds": 433.85,
    "end_seconds": 436.4,
    "text": "I think some people probably ought to do that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.400",
    "end": "00:07:19.550",
    "start_seconds": 436.4,
    "end_seconds": 439.55,
    "text": "And multiple choice questions have options."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.550",
    "end": "00:07:22.670",
    "start_seconds": 439.55,
    "end_seconds": 442.67,
    "text": "So I'm telling my clients, when you hear the options,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:22.670",
    "end": "00:07:26.840",
    "start_seconds": 442.67,
    "end_seconds": 446.84,
    "text": "just say to yourself, is it A, B, or C?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.840",
    "end": "00:07:28.970",
    "start_seconds": 446.84,
    "end_seconds": 448.97,
    "text": "You're lucky that they gave you options when"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.970",
    "end": "00:07:30.320",
    "start_seconds": 448.97,
    "end_seconds": 450.32,
    "text": "they ask the question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:30.320",
    "end": "00:07:32.300",
    "start_seconds": 450.32,
    "end_seconds": 452.3,
    "text": "And then there's fill in the blank questions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.300",
    "end": "00:07:36.020",
    "start_seconds": 452.3,
    "end_seconds": 456.02,
    "text": "which are always the ones where you may not know the answer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:36.020",
    "end": "00:07:38.900",
    "start_seconds": 456.02,
    "end_seconds": 458.9,
    "text": "How much did we spend three quarters ago?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:38.900",
    "end": "00:07:41.630",
    "start_seconds": 458.9,
    "end_seconds": 461.63,
    "text": "How much do you think we'll spend on the same"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:41.630",
    "end": "00:07:43.100",
    "start_seconds": 461.63,
    "end_seconds": 463.1,
    "text": "thing next year?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:43.100",
    "end": "00:07:44.450",
    "start_seconds": 463.1,
    "end_seconds": 464.45,
    "text": "When do you think you'll have it?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:44.450",
    "end": "00:07:47.390",
    "start_seconds": 464.45,
    "end_seconds": 467.39,
    "text": "All those questions are fill in the blank."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:47.390",
    "end": "00:07:50.300",
    "start_seconds": 467.39,
    "end_seconds": 470.3,
    "text": "And then finally, there are essay questions, which are the,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.300",
    "end": "00:07:53.480",
    "start_seconds": 470.3,
    "end_seconds": 473.48,
    "text": "what we've always come to call open-ended questions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:53.480",
    "end": "00:07:55.670",
    "start_seconds": 473.48,
    "end_seconds": 475.67,
    "text": "They all start with why and how."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.670",
    "end": "00:07:59.570",
    "start_seconds": 475.67,
    "end_seconds": 479.57,
    "text": "So I think that's how my clients, how all of us ought"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:59.570",
    "end": "00:08:02.690",
    "start_seconds": 479.57,
    "end_seconds": 482.69,
    "text": "to think about handling q and A. Does that make sense?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:02.690",
    "end": "00:08:03.770",
    "start_seconds": 482.69,
    "end_seconds": 483.77,
    "text": "- Oh, it makes complete sense."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:03.770",
    "end": "00:08:05.720",
    "start_seconds": 483.77,
    "end_seconds": 485.72,
    "text": "And you know, I've, I've heard this from you before."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:05.720",
    "end": "00:08:09.350",
    "start_seconds": 485.72,
    "end_seconds": 489.35,
    "text": "'cause I used to work with you, and this is brilliant,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:09.350",
    "end": "00:08:11.870",
    "start_seconds": 489.35,
    "end_seconds": 491.87,
    "text": "because so many people don't do this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:11.870",
    "end": "00:08:14.450",
    "start_seconds": 491.87,
    "end_seconds": 494.45,
    "text": "You ask them a very bottom line question"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:14.450",
    "end": "00:08:17.240",
    "start_seconds": 494.45,
    "end_seconds": 497.24,
    "text": "and they give you the essay answer instead"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:17.240",
    "end": "00:08:18.650",
    "start_seconds": 497.24,
    "end_seconds": 498.65,
    "text": "of giving you the yes no"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:18.650",
    "end": "00:08:20.750",
    "start_seconds": 498.65,
    "end_seconds": 500.75,
    "text": "or the fill in the blank, or the multiple choice."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:20.750",
    "end": "00:08:23.090",
    "start_seconds": 500.75,
    "end_seconds": 503.09,
    "text": "So you can distinguish yourself simply"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:23.090",
    "end": "00:08:26.090",
    "start_seconds": 503.09,
    "end_seconds": 506.09,
    "text": "by answering direct questions directly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:26.090",
    "end": "00:08:29.900",
    "start_seconds": 506.09,
    "end_seconds": 509.9,
    "text": "and not going on a tangent for every direct question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:29.900",
    "end": "00:08:32.120",
    "start_seconds": 509.9,
    "end_seconds": 512.12,
    "text": "And then of course, with essay questions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:32.120",
    "end": "00:08:33.680",
    "start_seconds": 512.12,
    "end_seconds": 513.68,
    "text": "sometimes you are asked a bigger question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:33.680",
    "end": "00:08:35.120",
    "start_seconds": 513.68,
    "end_seconds": 515.12,
    "text": "Just stay organized."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:35.120",
    "end": "00:08:36.680",
    "start_seconds": 515.12,
    "end_seconds": 516.68,
    "text": "This is another thing that Alan teaches."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:36.680",
    "end": "00:08:38.480",
    "start_seconds": 516.68,
    "end_seconds": 518.48,
    "text": "Give them talk in bullet points, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:38.480",
    "end": "00:08:41.840",
    "start_seconds": 518.48,
    "end_seconds": 521.84,
    "text": "First, second, third, keep your story organized,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:41.840",
    "end": "00:08:43.490",
    "start_seconds": 521.84,
    "end_seconds": 523.49,
    "text": "keep it composed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:43.490",
    "end": "00:08:44.900",
    "start_seconds": 523.49,
    "end_seconds": 524.9,
    "text": "Again, this is part one"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:44.900",
    "end": "00:08:48.020",
    "start_seconds": 524.9,
    "end_seconds": 528.02,
    "text": "of a three-part series on Allen's book, how"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:48.020",
    "end": "00:08:49.070",
    "start_seconds": 528.02,
    "end_seconds": 529.07,
    "text": "to Become a Highflier (Highflier Handbook),"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:49.070",
    "end": "00:08:50.690",
    "start_seconds": 529.07,
    "end_seconds": 530.69,
    "text": "and How You Can Become a Leader At Work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.690",
    "end": "00:08:53.660",
    "start_seconds": 530.69,
    "end_seconds": 533.66,
    "text": "We're going to put links to his book in the description below."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:53.660",
    "end": "00:08:55.850",
    "start_seconds": 533.66,
    "end_seconds": 535.85,
    "text": "Please stay tuned for part two"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:55.850",
    "end": "00:08:57.350",
    "start_seconds": 535.85,
    "end_seconds": 537.35,
    "text": "where we're going to talk about whether"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:57.350",
    "end": "00:08:59.930",
    "start_seconds": 537.35,
    "end_seconds": 539.93,
    "text": "or not you're a born leader and what you can do about it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:59.930",
    "end": "00:09:01.340",
    "start_seconds": 539.93,
    "end_seconds": 541.34,
    "text": "Thanks for hanging out with this, Allen."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:01.340",
    "end": "00:09:02.660",
    "start_seconds": 541.34,
    "end_seconds": 542.66,
    "text": "- Well, thank you, Alex."
  }
]
